WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.910 --> 00:00:03.940
Every day has a pulse.

2
00:00:03.990 --> 00:00:10.980
But yours is scattered,
across nine different apps.

3
00:00:12.130 --> 00:00:16.280
Pulse brings it all into one place.

4
00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:25.620
Your plans, the weather and your apps,
all at a glance.

5
00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:36.020
Every app and site you use,
one click away.

6
00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:48.940
Your calendar, your to-dos, your habits,
all keeping time.

7
00:00:54.430 --> 00:00:58.220
Tell it what you need, and it's done.

8
00:00:58.830 --> 00:01:02.160
Or just talk to it.

9
00:01:03.310 --> 00:01:07.320
<v Pulse>You've got the design review at nine
thirty, lunch with Sam at one,

10
00:01:07.370 --> 00:01:11.880
<v Pulse>and your flight to Tokyo leaves at six
forty tonight.

11
00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:23.960
Markets, as they move. Live news,
from your street to the other side of the

12
00:01:24.010 --> 00:01:28.920
world. And every fixture,
for every team you follow.

13
00:01:31.330 --> 00:01:34.960
Music has a room of its own.

14
00:01:35.110 --> 00:01:39.420
Connect Spotify,
and your playlists are right there.

15
00:01:39.470 --> 00:01:44.720
Then step inside the song,
lit by its colours,

16
00:01:44.770 --> 00:01:48.560
with every word in time.

17
00:01:55.030 --> 00:02:02.640
When you travel, it comes with you.
Your flight, the route, the local time,

18
00:02:02.690 --> 00:02:06.640
and everything you'll need the moment you
land.

19
00:02:07.950 --> 00:02:11.460
Remember how scattered it all felt?

20
00:02:11.510 --> 00:02:16.440
From nine apps to one.

21
00:02:16.490 --> 00:02:21.180
Everything your day needs,
finally together.

22
00:02:21.330 --> 00:02:26.820
Pulse OS. Your day, in a heartbeat.

